          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha Mwenyezi Mlungu achiniamba, “Aambire, Mimi Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wa majeshi, Mlungu wa Iziraeli naamba, ‘Nwani mlewe hata muhaphike, mugbwe na msiweze kuima tsona, kpwa sababu ya nyo upanga ndioureha kahi yenu.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela achirema kuchihala cho chikombe kula mwako mikononi, phahi undaambira, ‘Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wa majeshi anaamba ni munwe hangu mnalonda hata kale tamlonda! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana lola, ninaandza kuuhenda mai mudzi uihwao kpwa dzina rangu, dze, ikale mudzi huno undaepuka kutiywa adabu? Taandaepuka bii, mana atu osi aishio duniani naatayarishira upanga, Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wa majeshi.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
